(21724,'sp_ack_email_default_43','{\"subject\":\"Contact the Practice - [PRACTICE]\",\"body\":\"Dear [PATIENT], <p>Thank you for submitting a message to the practice. <p>One of our receptionists will reply to you as soon as possible via email. We will try to respond to all queries within 2 working days. Please note that this service is not for urgent medical enquiries. <p><strong><em>[PRACTICE]<\\/em><\\/strong>\"}','no'),
