e Listings Form Template\",\"slug\":\"real-estate-listings-form\",\"description\":\"Show Real Estate listings on your site. First add listings in a form, then create a view to display them.\",\"id\":20873677,\"released\":\"2017-01-23 18:56:44\",\"categories\":[\"Personal\",\"Real Estate\"],\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/formidableforms.com\\/form-templates\\/real-estate-listings-form\\/\",\"icon\":false,\"key\":\"real-estate-listings\",\"used_addons\":[],\"expires\":\"1769126399\",\"code\":\"valid\",\"date\":\"2013-02-18 00:00:00\",\"type\":\"business\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/s3.amazonaws.com\\/fp.strategy11.com\\/form-templates\\/real-estate-listings-form.xml?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIAJ3QHAN4BJMSYZ3ZQ&Expires=1744084459&Signature=WW0sEN5n%2F9K0yoFOb6jvu1X68RQ%3D\",\"is_new\":false},\"20874045\":{\"name\":\"Job Application Form Template\",\"slug\":\"job-application-form\",\"description\":\"Streamline your hiring process by collecting employment applications online and get more applications.\",\"id\":20874045,\"released\":\"2017-01-25 15:33:33\",\"categories\":[\"Application\",\"Personal\"],\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/formidableforms.com\\/form-templates\\/job-application-form\\/\",\"icon\":false,\"key\":\"job-application\",\"used_addons\":[],\"expires\":\"1769126399\",\"code\":\"valid\",\"date\":\"2013-02-18 00:00:00\",\"type\":\"business\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/s3.amazonaws.com\\/fp.strategy11.com\\/form-templates\\/job-application-form.xml?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIAJ3QHAN4BJMSYZ3ZQ&Expires=1744084459&Signature=1cPZsCSylTH5my6iFHOS8EByyIw%3D\",\"is_new\":false},\"20874049\":{\"name\":\"Emergency Contact Form Template\",\"slug\":\"emergency-contact-form\",\"description\":\"Protect your clients and be prepared for any situation by collecting emergency contact and basic medical information.\",\"id\":20874049,\"released\":\"2019-01-01 15:50:21\",\"categories\":[\"Business\",\"Contact\"],\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/formidableforms.com\\/form-templates\\/emergency-contact-form\\/\",\"icon\":false,\"key\