d_6681_container\" class=\"frm_form_field frm_section_heading form-field \">\r\n<h3 class=\"frm_pos_top frm_section_spacing\">Further questions</h3>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div id=\"frm_field_6687_container\" class=\"frm_form_field form-field  frm_top_container\">\r\n    <div class=\"frm_label frm_primary_label\">Are you happy with your treatment?\r\n        \r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\'textarea\' style=\'min-height:43px\'>[6687]</div>\r\n    \r\n    \r\n</div>\n<div id=\"frm_field_6690_container\" class=\"frm_form_field form-field  frm_top_container\">\r\n    <div class=\"frm_label frm_primary_label\">Have you had recent changes in your treatment or flares of your disease?\r\n        \r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\'textarea\' style=\'min-height:43px\'>[6690]</div>\r\n    \r\n    \r\n</div>\n<div id=\"frm_field_6693_container\" class=\"frm_form_field form-field  frm_top_container\">\r\n    <div class=\"frm_label frm_primary_label\">Do you feel you need more support or aids at home and if so, can you describe why and what you think you might need?\r\n        \r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\'textarea\' style=\'min-height:43px\'>[6693]</div>\r\n    \r\n    \r\n</div>\n<div id=\"frm_field_6696_container\" class=\"frm_form_field form-field  frm_top_container\">\r\n    <div class=\"frm_label frm_primary_label\">Have you had any falls in the last year? If so, how many?\r\n        \r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\'textarea\' style=\'min-height:43px\'>[6696]</div>\r\n    \r\n    \r\n</div>\n<div id=\"frm_field_6699_container\" class=\"frm_form_field form-field  frm_top_container\">\r\n    <div class=\"frm_label frm_primary_label\">Do you feel that you are managing and tolerating your current medications?\r\n        \r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\'textarea\' style=\'min-height:43px\'>[6699]</div>\r\n    \r\n    \r\n</div>\n<div id=\"frm_field_6702_container\" class=\"frm_form_field form-field  frm_top_container\">\r\n    <div class=\"frm_label frm_primary_label\">Do you have any questions about your medications?\r\n        \r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\'textarea\' style=\'min-height:43px\'>[6702]</div>\r\n    \r\n    \r\n</div>\n<div id=\"frm_field_6705_container\" class=\"frm_form_field form-field  frm_top_container\">\r\n    <div class=\"frm_label frm_primary_label\">Is there any history of osteoporosis in your family?\r\n        \r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\'textarea\' style=\'min-height:43px\'>[6705]</div>\r\n    \r\n    \r\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"frm_field_6711_container\" class=\"frm_form_field frm_section_heading form-field \">\r\n<h3 class=\"frm_pos_top frm_section_spacing\"></h3>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div id=\"frm_field_6714_container\" class=\"frm_form_field  frm_html_container form-field\">\n<p>Over the last 2 weeks, how often have you been bothered by the following problems?</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"frm_field_6717_container\" class=\"frm_form_field form-field  frm_top_container frm_first frm_half vertical_radio\">\r\n    <div  id=\"field_5d334_label\" class=\"frm_primary_label\">Little interest or pleasure in doing things:\r\n        \r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"frm_opt_container\" aria-labelledby=\"field_5d334_label\" role=\"group\">		<div class=\"frm_radio\" id=\"frm_radio_6717-6711-0\"><img class=\'radio\' src=\'/wp-content/plugins/spForms/images/radio_[[6717]=Not at all].png\'><div class=\"frm_label\">		 Not at all</div></div>\n		<div class=\"frm_radio\" id=\"frm_radio_6717-6711-1\"><img class=\'radio\' src=\'/wp-content/plugins/spForms/images/radio_[[6717]=On Several days].png\'><div class=\"frm_label\">		 On Several days</div></div>\n		<div class=\"frm_radio\" id=\"frm_radio_6717-6711-2\"><img class=\'radio\' src=\'/wp-content/plugins/spForms/images/radio_[[6717]=More than half the days].png\'><div class=\"frm_label\">		 More than half the days</div></div>\n		<div class=\"frm_radio\" id=\"frm_radio_6717-6711-3\"><img class=\'radio\' src=\'/wp-content/plugins/spForms/images/radio_[[6717]=Nearly every day].png\'