hageal cancer diagnosis\", \"heart burn\", \"oesophageal cancer causes\", \"dysphagia\", \"Oesophageal cancer treatment\", \"Oesophagus\", \"Cancer and tumours\"], \"code\": [{\"@type\": \"MedicalCode\", \"codeValue\": \"\", \"codingSystem\": \"SNOMED-CT\"}]}, \"url\": \"https://api.nhs.uk/conditions/oesophageal-cancer/\", \"name\": \"Oesophageal cancer\"}, {\"description\": \"Read about orthodontics, a type of dentistry that aims to improve the appearance, position and function of crooked, protruding or crowded teeth.\", \"linkRelationship\": \"Result\", \"@type\": \"LinkRole\", \"articleStatus\": \"published\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"MedicalWebPage\", \"genre\": \"condition\", \"datePublished\": \"2017-10-23T13:23:33+00:00\", \"dateModified\": \"2020-01-29T18:11:46+00:00\", \"lastReviewed\": [\"2020-01-27T00:00:00+00:00\", \"2023-01-27T00:00:00+00:00\"], \"reviewDue\": \"2023-01-27T00:00:00+00:00\", \"keywords\": [\"Teeth\", \"Orthodontics\", \"Dentists\", \"Gums\"], \"code\": [{\"@type\": \"MedicalCode\", \"codeValue\": \"\", \"codingSystem\": \"SNOMED-CT\"}]}, \"url\": \"https://api.nhs.uk/conditions/orthodontics/\", \"name\": \"Orthodontics\"}, {\"description\": \"Read about osteoarthritis, a condition that causes the joints to become painful and stiff. It\'s the most common type of arthritis in the UK.\", \"linkRelationship\": \"Result\", \"@type\": \"LinkRole\", \"articleStatus\": \"published\", \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"MedicalWebPage\", \"genre\": \"condition\", \"datePublished\": \"2017-10-23T09:59:00+00:00\", \"dateModified\": \"2020-02-21T15:30:12+00:00\", \"lastReviewed\": [\"2019-08-19T00:00:00+00:00\", \"2022-08-19T00:00:00+00:00\"], \"reviewDue\": \"2022-08-19T00:00:00+00:00\", \"keywords\": [\"Arthritis\", \"Osteoarthritis\", \"Joints\"], \"code\": [{\"@type\": \"MedicalCode\", \"codeValue\": \"\", \"codingSystem\": \"SNOMED-CT\"}]}, \"url\": \"https://api.nhs.uk/conditions/osteoarthritis/\", \"name\": \"Osteoarthritis\"}, {\"